{"version":1,"content":"<p>紐約州州長凱西·霍赫爾已籤署一項法案，限制汽車製造商、經銷商及第三方服務商向消費者收取車輛內置功能的訂閲費或購車後解鎖費。該法案編號為S.9348A/A.10411A，將於2027年2月27日正式生效。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587828.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T08:24:00.415155+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T08:07:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T08:17:15.552671+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T08:17:15.552671+00:00","content_hash":"5837c9f58a0a738bf9b7cde26baca59bf67acf3cba8cf005f668034ab9a10fb4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}